speechtext:
I believe you will find consent for the following motion;
That when no further members rise to speak today on Bill C-116, the debate shall be deemed adjourned; and
That notwithstanding any Standing Order on Tbesday, March 30, 1993 the House shall sit between 1 and 2 p.m. for the sole purpose of the continuing consideration of the second reading stage motion of Bill C-116; and
That not later than 1.55 p.m., all questions necessary to dispose of the said motion shall be put without further debate or amendment;
And that any recorded division be deferred until 5 p.m. on Tbesday, March 30, 1993.
